  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Conceptual diagram of the summary tables (Fig. 7). On the left, boxes 2a 'Costs of not acting: health outcomes' and 2b 'Costs of not acting: risk factors'; an orange arrow labelled 'Potential solutions' points to boxes 3a '\"Best buy\" interventions by risk factor' (tobacco, alcohol, diet, physical inactivity, infection), 3b '\"Best buy\" interventions by health outcome' (CVD and diabetes, cancer, respiratory disease), 4a resilience (violence and abuse, mental health), 4b social determinants (housing, debt, employment), 4c environmental determinants (road traffic injuries, green space, climate, active transport, environmental hazards) and 4d vaccination and screening.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
